00:04:22.488 --> 00:04:24.821
(mumbles)

00:04:27.285 --> 00:04:28.796
(mumbles)

00:04:28.796 --> 00:04:30.379
What's this song?

00:04:32.504 --> 00:04:35.212
That's hard to translate into English

00:04:35.212 --> 00:04:39.629
it's about hazel nut is dark brown

00:04:39.629 --> 00:04:41.212
Hazel nut is what?

00:04:41.212 --> 00:04:43.187
Its a dark brown.

00:04:43.187 --> 00:04:45.256
Hazel nut is dark brown?

00:04:45.256 --> 00:04:46.846
And you should be the same color.

00:04:46.846 --> 00:04:48.431
