00:05:40.155 --> 00:05:42.300
Andy what bar are we at now?

00:05:42.300 --> 00:05:44.530
We are at Marie's Riptide lounge.

00:05:44.530 --> 00:05:48.239
Now we should point out the
holiday decorations here

00:05:48.239 --> 00:05:50.830
are like no other place,

00:05:50.830 --> 00:05:52.160
can you describe what we have there

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:54.270
behind the bar for us, Marie?

00:05:54.270 --> 00:05:55.830
Well it's something I decided to do

00:05:55.830 --> 00:05:59.810
many years old is going
out for 34 years now,

00:05:59.810 --> 00:06:01.722
every Christmas I put this up.

00:06:01.722 --> 00:06:03.698
(Conan) Ooh, spooky.

00:06:03.698 --> 00:06:05.220
(Andy) Yeah, it's kind of a...

00:06:05.220 --> 00:06:07.188
by the blue lights there.

00:06:07.188 --> 00:06:08.678
(Conan)It's a little frightening

00:06:08.678 --> 00:06:10.630
and beautiful at the same time.

00:06:10.630 --> 00:06:13.960
it makes you see the patrons
it makes everything white.

00:06:13.960 --> 00:06:14.793
It makes everything white.

00:06:14.793 --> 00:06:16.009
Yeah, glow.

00:06:16.009 --> 00:06:18.954
It also shows up the plaque on your teeth.

00:06:18.954 --> 00:06:20.652
(laughs)

00:06:20.652 --> 00:06:22.910
The first time Andy
Richter walked in the door,

00:06:22.910 --> 00:06:24.443
did you say to yourself,

00:06:24.443 --> 00:06:27.720
that kid is destined for greatness?

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:28.553
I thought about it

00:06:28.553 --> 00:06:29.430
I wasn't too sure at the time

00:06:29.430 --> 00:06:30.796
and I'm not too sure now.

00:06:30.796 --> 00:06:32.240
(laughs)

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:33.200
Still not sure

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:35.380
And the red has a Santa clause,

00:06:35.380 --> 00:06:37.172
Do you really have to go?

00:06:37.172 --> 00:06:39.500
And Santa Clause takes one, look at her,

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:41.182
and he said, 'ho ho ho, I got to go

00:06:41.182 --> 00:06:44.120
my rangers are out in the snow.'

00:06:44.120 --> 00:06:47.700
So she stands up and
she drops the negligee

00:06:47.700 --> 00:06:52.700
and she says, 'Oh Santa Clause,
do you really have to go?'

00:06:53.730 --> 00:06:56.250
Well he takes one look at her and he says,

00:06:56.250 --> 00:06:58.890
'Hey hey hey I better stay,

00:06:58.890 --> 00:07:01.557
I will never make it up
to Chimney this way.'

00:07:02.436 --> 00:07:04.519
(laughs)

00:07:06.835 --> 00:07:08.511
Can I use that, is that alright?

00:07:08.511 --> 00:07:10.258
Ooh you can have it.

00:07:10.258 --> 00:07:12.839
All right I can have it.

00:07:12.839 --> 00:07:15.672
(classical music)

00:07:30.417 --> 00:07:33.123
Well I wish you all a
merry, merry Christmas.

00:07:34.857 --> 00:07:36.161
(audience applauds).

00:07:36.161 --> 00:07:37.592
We learnt a great deal I think.

00:07:37.592 --> 00:07:39.539
Yeah we sure did.

00:07:39.539 --> 00:07:40.872
(clapping)

00:07:40.872 --> 00:07:44.010
And we also... we learnt a great deal.

00:07:44.010 --> 00:07:46.020
Now ladies and gentlemen,

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:47.140
we also point out that.

00:07:47.140 --> 00:07:49.150
that was just setting the table actually

00:07:49.150 --> 00:07:49.983
for what happened?

00:07:49.983 --> 00:07:52.720
We actually had decided to...

00:07:52.720 --> 00:07:54.290
tell them what we did in a nutshell.

00:07:54.290 --> 00:07:56.130
Well we went to check out and see who

00:07:56.130 --> 00:07:57.810
was living in my old apartment.

00:07:57.810 --> 00:07:59.720
Right, We went to check that out.

00:07:59.720 --> 00:08:01.780
Yeah, and some interesting
things happened.

00:08:01.780 --> 00:08:05.238
And you'll see that actually
on tomorrow night show.

00:08:05.238 --> 00:08:07.960
There was just too much
Chicago for one show.

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:08.793
Yeah.

00:08:08.793 --> 00:08:10.403
What? you don't have TVs.

00:08:10.403 --> 00:08:11.236
(laughs)

00:08:11.236 --> 00:08:12.503
I was gonna,

00:08:13.600 --> 00:08:16.300
obviously don't use them
for this program that's all.

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:17.133
All right.

00:08:17.133 --> 00:08:17.966
(chuckles)

00:08:17.966 --> 00:08:19.030
Anyway ladies and Gentlemen watch for that

00:08:19.030 --> 00:08:21.410
and also our thanks to the city of Chicago

00:08:21.410 --> 00:08:23.669
in the 85 bars that helped
us out with that piece.

00:08:23.669 --> 00:08:24.502
(laughs)

00:08:24.502 --> 00:08:25.460
We're going to take a break folks,

00:08:25.460 --> 00:08:27.270
when we come back, Greg
Kinnear is gonna be with us

00:08:27.270 --> 00:08:28.204
so stick around.

00:08:28.204 --> 00:08:30.287
(shouts)

